      "message": "\u003e Tbf, I\u0027m very surprised that something called static_libs wouldn\u0027t be in the APK\n\nThat would make sense if the `android_library_imports` target that is referenced from `android_app` is via `libs`. That is, I would expect:\n\n(bar ends up in classes.dex)\napp -\u003e static_libs -\u003e android_library_imports -\u003e static_libs -\u003e bar\n\n(bar does *not* end up in classes.dex)\napp -\u003e libs -\u003e android_library_imports -\u003e static_libs -\u003e bar\n\nis that not what you\u0027re seeing?",
